### Create transfer
POST http://localhost:8081/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idempotencyKey": "K8S-TEST-001",
  "fromAccountId": 1,
  "toAccountId": 2,
  "amount": 500.00,
  "description": "Kubernetes test"
}

#### Get transfer by ID
GET http://localhost:8081/api/transfers/1

### Get all transfers
GET http://localhost:8081/api/transfers